## Scope

The MIT grant above covers the source code of this project only.

It does not, and cannot, grant any right over third-party material that this
repository bundles or fetches at runtime:

- **Warframe game data and intellectual property.** Relic, Prime part, mission
  and drop-rate data originates from Digital Extremes' official drop tables.
  Warframe and all associated names, marks and game content are the property of
  Digital Extremes Ltd. This project is an unofficial fan tool, is not
  affiliated with or endorsed by Digital Extremes, and is distributed free of
  charge in line with the Warframe Content Policy
  (https://www.warframe.com/en/contentpolicy).

- **Market data** retrieved from the warframe.market public API belongs to
  warframe.market and the users who post the listings. This project is not
  affiliated with warframe.market.

- **Bundled fonts.** Inter and Cinzel are licensed under the SIL Open Font
  License 1.1, not MIT. See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md and the OFL.txt files
  distributed alongside the font binaries.

- **Third-party dependencies** declared in pom.xml and package.json remain
  under their own licenses. See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.
